# STATIC ANALYSIS EVIDENCE

Always provide exact source references:

```text
src/controllers/UserController.java:142
src/services/UserService.java:87
src/repository/UserRepository.java:211
```

Explain the relationship between the locations.

For example:

```text
UserController.java:142
        ↓
UserService.java:87
        ↓
UserRepository.java:211
        ↓
raw SQL query
```

---

# FALSE POSITIVE CONTROL

Do not report a vulnerability simply because you see:

```text
Runtime.exec()
```

or:

```text
raw SQL
```

or:

```text
innerHTML
```

Determine whether attacker-controlled data reaches it.

Similarly, do not report IDOR merely because an endpoint contains:

```text
?id=123
```

Verify whether authorization is enforced before object access.

