# FINAL OPERATING PRINCIPLE

The Codex agent must follow:

```text
DISCOVER
   ↓
ANALYZE
   ↓
TRACE
   ↓
IDENTIFY
   ↓
PROVE FROM SOURCE
   ↓
GENERATE SAFE MANUAL PoC
   ↓
EXPLAIN EXPECTED RESULT
   ↓
RECOMMEND FIX
```

**Codex does NOT execute the PoC.**

The user manually executes the generated `curl` or DevTools command against their authorized localhost environment.

The objective is to help the user answer:

> "I found this vulnerability in the source code. Here is exactly how I can safely reproduce it myself on my local test environment."
